    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automation and Magic:</strong> Build and connect magical machines that channel and convert cursed energy into life, forming intricate, self-sustaining systems.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/fa41a688a6f34d8fe9ef4ca4abe52be8.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/fa41a688a6f34d8fe9ef4ca4abe52be8.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Terraforming:</strong> Cleanse a cursed, fog-covered island and transform it into a thriving, vibrant ecosystem using arcane technology.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/67ff1733a64226a2817f1099e8a4ecde.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/67ff1733a64226a2817f1099e8a4ecde.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Living World:</strong> See real-time environmental transformation\u2014watch as dead forests bloom, creatures return, and storms shift with the rise of magic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/4da53f843c45be413625abe2b3adefb1.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/4da53f843c45be413625abe2b3adefb1.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Crafting:</strong> Gather rare materials, refine them through magical processes, and fuel your growing terraforming network.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/4e44970d1e632a7afea5ed575a8a8d1d.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/4e44970d1e632a7afea5ed575a8a8d1d.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Base Building:</strong> Construct small castles with an easy, modular building system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/f5683a1cf5dd575432070a11b4dee7a1.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/f5683a1cf5dd575432070a11b4dee7a1.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and Uncover:</strong> Discover lost blueprints, ancient technologies, and hidden lore scattered across a mysterious open world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/31c2a3da73e4ab24d5dd17f3fa6eb16e.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/31c2a3da73e4ab24d5dd17f3fa6eb16e.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill Survival:</strong> No combat. Light survival elements focused on exploration, creativity, and progress\u2014not punishment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/1b9902c4faea7a32119a0175512e72fc.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/1b9902c4faea7a32119a0175512e72fc.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Aesthetic:</strong> Early-2010s RPG visuals and mysterious vibes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/981586177292b5eef53da0f0ba41911a.poster.avif?t=1746418788\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649320/extras/981586177292b5eef53da0f0ba41911a.webm?t=1746418788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
